   braille pages (nfb.org), the Smithsonian National Museum of the American Indian (americanindian.si.edu) for khipu,
   and the archived key stage 2 unit pages (raspberrypi.org/curriculum/archived/key-stage-2).
5. **Row changes** (three notes cells; the lead applies them, listed in the final message): g2-people-solve's notes
   gain the E2-SOC-HU-15 half (familiar machines made for an everyday problem); g2-data-questions' example "which
