othing taught after them and hand on only to grade 5, so it can follow the year-end check, which the core check weeks 27 and 30 to 32 hold at week 24. Machine learning sits with the society rows because its own row teaches the algorithm and the human-learning comparison as one story. Our own (the partial base's Year 5 has no machine learning or society unit) | Candidate: dropped, a visit by a local worker who uses a computing tool; the cases carry the row and a visit needs a school's own arrangement, zero days | Native content (Mary Golda Ross, Cherokee Nation): told as her own work, from the nation's and the agencies' own pages, never as a symbol. Black history (Katherine Johnson, Jerry Lawson) and women's history: contributions, not barriers alone. Work change can touch a family whose job changed or was lost: no student is asked about a family member's work; the cases are invented people. Agent reads: sensitivity (the starting pack in Sensitivity reads first). |

