   construct of the two Year 5 programming units, is grade 3's here (g3-algorithm-combo, E3-PRO-PD-04), so "Selection
   in quizzes" is used for its quiz-building and testing order, with selection as review; "Selection in physical
   computing" is left out (it needs a microcontroller board, and its idea is grade 3's). "Flat-file databases" lesson
   4 (search tools with conditions) is offered to the grade 6 frame (g6-sort-filter-tool).
